# License text and attributions, copied into every image (/usr/share/licenses/cloud-native-ros).
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES
# Host-side bytecode never enters a build context: a judge run on the host imports
# modules from sources/ and writes __pycache__ there; the next build then misses the
# cache and a rebuilt colcon layer gets another image ID (S2-B control, 30 September
# 2026, results/evidence/runs/LIFECYCLE_REGRESSIONS.md). Last, so they win over the
# includes above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# The px4_msgs submodule's .git is a FILE naming its worktree-specific gitdir: every worktree
# had another build context, so control-plane, event-detector, state-bridge and mission-observer
# got new image IDs, and event-detector's final stage kept it in the /ws/src layer (Dockerfile
# line 40). Decided by Viviana on 2 October 2026 (option 1, R14_WRAPPER_DESIGN_DRAFT.md 12-13);
# last, so it wins over "!integrations/px4_msgs/**".
integrations/px4_msgs/.git
